    "comment": "canvas-eil: TEST_SESSION_SECRET/TEST_DATABASE_URL (config.ts) are deliberate, non-sensitive test-only fixtures gated behind NODE_ENV=test (canvas-uw8) -- production always requires the real env var via requireEnv(), which throws if unset. Bearer's static heuristic pattern-matches a literal assigned to a *SECRET*-named const with no awareness of that gating. Confirmed via a local, unredacted full-repo bearer scan against this exact commit (fingerprint is repo-scan-scoped -- differs from a single-file scan of config.ts alone).",
